Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \n",
 "Advanced Lesson 16\n\nPackages\n\nDr. Dale R. Doty\nUniversity of Tulsa"
}], "Title"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["  What Packages Are Available In ", "Subtitle"],
 StyleBox["Mathematica", "Subtitle",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["?", "Subtitle"]
}], "Section"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{" ", 
  RowBox[{"Remove", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", " ", "]"}], " "}]], "InputOnly"],

Cell[TextData[{
 " ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 3.0/4.0/5.0/6.0/ ... have many categories of standard add-on packages.  \
Each package category has 2 to 25 additional sub-categories.  In all, the \
standard add-on packages add over 1000 additional functions for use in ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ".\n\n",
 StyleBox["Older",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " primary package categories included (for ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 5.0):\n\n\tAlgebra\n\tCalculus\n\tDiscrete Mathematics\n\tGeometry\n\t\
Graphics\n\tLinear Algebra\n\tMiscellaneous\n\tNumber Theory\n\tNumerical \
Mathematics\n\tStatistics\n\tUtilities\n\t\nThe list of packages is much \
longer today.\n\n\nAs an example, consider the packages in the ",
 StyleBox["older",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " package category Statistics (for ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 5.0):\n\n\tANOVA\t\n\tConfidenceIntervals\n\tContinuousDistributions\n\t\
DataManipulation\n\tDataSmoothing\n\tDescriptiveStatistics\n\t\
DiscreteDistributions\n\tHypothesisTests\n\tLinearRepression\n\t\
MultiDescriptiveStatistics\n\tMultiNormalDistribution\n\tNonlinearFit\n\t\
NormalDistribution\n\tStatisticsPlots\n\tCommon\n\t\nThe current version of ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " that you are using will have a completely different list of Packages. To \
see what is there, you might look in the following subdirectory on your C: \
drive (make changes for your version of ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and your computer operating system):  \n\n\tC:\\Program Files\\Wolfram \
Research\\Mathematica\\8.0\\AddOns\\Packages\n\nIn addition, ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " packages are available from a number of different sources (some for free, \
and some that are commercial).  If you have a specific need that is extremely \
involved, then it is worth your time to search for existing ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " packages rather then programming your own."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900474182184*^9, 3.3900474211534*^9}, {
   3.3900492548164*^9, 3.3900492897714*^9}, {3.3900493704203997`*^9, 
   3.3900493733174*^9}, {3.460907652934837*^9, 3.460907666684925*^9}, {
   3.4609076968726177`*^9, 3.4609079103114843`*^9}, {3.4609079414835587`*^9, 
   3.4609081796725826`*^9}, {3.523621586337076*^9, 3.5236215881770945`*^9}, 
   3.523621663057843*^9}]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["  How Do I Load A Package?", "Subtitle"]], "Section"],

Cell["\<\
 There are several procedures for loading and using packages:\
\>", "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
<<name reads in a file, evaluating each expression in it, and returning the \
last one.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3900472467434*^9, 3.3900475411744003`*^9},
 FontWeight->"Bold"],

Cell["\<\
Needs[\"context`\"] loads an appropriate file if the specified context is not \
already in $Packages. 
  Needs[\"context`\", \"file\"] loads file if the specified context is not \
already in $Packages.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3900472512994003`*^9, 3.3900475529264*^9},
 FontWeight->"Bold"],

Cell["\<\
$Packages gives a list of the contexts corresponding to all packages which \
have been loaded in your current Mathematica session.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3900472529254*^9, 3.3900475585064*^9},
 FontWeight->"Bold"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData["$Packages"], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"newContext`\"\>", ",", "\<\"ResourceLocator`\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"DocumentationSearch`\"\>", ",", "\<\"GetFEKernelInit`\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"JLink`\"\>", ",", "\<\"PacletManager`\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"WebServices`\"\>", ",", "\<\"System`\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"Global`\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.5236217670988836`*^9}]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "\nPackages are located on your hard disk with specification:   directory` \
packagename`   where \"directory\" is the location of the file containing the \
package \"packagename\".  For example, the package category:  \
\"NumericalCalculus`\",  which contains the package: NLimit.m   is located on \
my hard disk in directory: \"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Wolfram \
Research\\\\Mathematica\\\\7.0\\\\AddOns\\\\Packages\\\\NumericalCalculus\\\\\
NLimit.m\". All directories can be entered directly into a ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " Notebook by using the: \"Insert\" menu at the top of your screen followed \
by: File Path.  However, standard add-on packages are located in known \
sub-directories, and therefore ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " can find them automatically (this is not the case for a non-standard \
package).\n "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900476480214*^9, 3.3900476766284*^9}, 
   3.460907123900201*^9, {3.4609071629317007`*^9, 3.460907229494627*^9}, {
   3.460907260994828*^9, 3.460907267963623*^9}, 3.52362178974911*^9}]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["  Example:", "Subtitle"]], "Section"],

Cell["\<\
As an example, consider \"NumericalCalculus`\".  
The package that accomplishes this is: NumericalCalculus.m and is located in \
subdirectory:  Packages.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.3900477283004*^9, {3.3900479493124*^9, 3.3900479582344*^9}, {
   3.460906153737742*^9, 3.4609061919879866`*^9}, {3.460906837632744*^9, 
   3.4609068499140725`*^9}}],

Cell["\<\

Load the package:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900479938274*^9, 3.3900480061394*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<NumericalCalculus`\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4609057998604774`*^9, 3.4609058077355275`*^9}, 
   3.4609061375813885`*^9, 3.460906536724568*^9}],

Cell["\<\

Check the current default context:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.523630439185604*^9}],

Cell[BoxData["$Context"], "Input"],

Cell["\<\

Check the current context path:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.523630436305575*^9}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"  ", "$ContextPath"}]], "Input"],

Cell["\<\

Note that the desired package has been loaded (along with all necessary \
additional supporting packages).

We can now display the primary functions contained in this package.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3900480234554*^9, 3.5236304328655405`*^9}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"?", "NumericalCalculus`*"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900477389894*^9, 3.3900477568834*^9}, 
   3.3900477885134*^9, {3.3900479677014*^9, 3.3900479716404*^9}, 
   3.460906599818722*^9}],

Cell["\<\

 In particular, we can get information on the specific function that we are \
about to use:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900482699314003`*^9, 3.3900483033194*^9}, 
   3.523630443995652*^9}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"?", "NLimit"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3900482009454*^9, 3.4609066224282417`*^9}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"NLimit", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["x", "3"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "x", "]"}]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"5", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["x", "3"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{"Log", "[", "x", "]"}]}]], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"x", "\[Rule]", "\[Infinity]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.3900482433014*^9, {3.3900483152854*^9, 3.3900483505144*^9}, {
   3.460906671678557*^9, 3.460906679616108*^9}}]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox[" Exercises:", "Title"],
 "  Advanced Lesson 16 "
}], "Section"],

Cell["\<\
Your Name:

Your Math Class:\
\>", "Program",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.390368232619*^9, 3.3903682391219997`*^9}, {
   3.390368866851*^9, 3.390368908736*^9}, {3.3903690435030003`*^9, 
   3.390369082222*^9}, 3.3903880065649595`*^9},
 FontSize->16,
 FontWeight->"Bold"],

Cell["\<\
1:  Load all of the functions contained in: ComputerArithmetic`\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900490099714003`*^9, 3.3900490122094*^9}, {
  3.3900490930854*^9, 3.3900490952743998`*^9}}],

Cell["\<\
2:  Display all of the packages contained in the current context path.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell["\<\
3:  Obtain information on all primary functions in:  ComputerArithmetic`.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900491393984003`*^9, 3.3900491529074*^9}}],

Cell["\<\
4:  Obtain what information there is on: MicroscopicErrorPlot[...].\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3900492140364*^9, 3.3900492177164*^9}}],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Print",
  FontSize->14,
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[" your homework exercises",
  FontSize->14],
 ".\n",
 StyleBox["But do ",
  FontSize->14,
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],
 StyleBox["NOT",
  FontSize->18,
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],
 StyleBox[" print the above lesson along with the exercises!",
  FontSize->14,
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3903491193324003`*^9, 3.3903491706104*^9}, {
   3.3903492171244*^9, 3.3903492363613997`*^9}, {3.3903493057854*^9, 
   3.3903493616624002`*^9}, {3.390367829311*^9, 3.390368046703*^9}, {
   3.390368151425*^9, 3.390368157087*^9}, {3.3903689909309998`*^9, 
   3.390369020223*^9}, {3.390369115093*^9, 3.390369186012*^9}, {
   3.3903692234300003`*^9, 3.390369566137*^9}, {3.390369653565*^9, 
   3.390369672512*^9}, {3.390369704873*^9, 3.3903697467469997`*^9}, {
   3.390369895852*^9, 3.390369997834*^9}, {3.390370474823*^9, 
   3.390370498811*^9}, 3.3903705605439997`*^9, {3.390370625072*^9, 
   3.390370690086*^9}, {3.390374898767*^9, 3.390374902177*^9}, {
   3.390383169347*^9, 3.390383198519*^9}, 3.39038573018396*^9, {
   3.3903876565289598`*^9, 3.3903876566309595`*^9}, {3.39038798227396*^9, 
   3.3903879827329597`*^9}, {3.39038855499296*^9, 3.39038855570596*^9}, {
   3.390425911413*^9, 3.390425911724*^9}, {3.3904275729119997`*^9, 
   3.39042758298*^9}}]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]]
